<title>UK: BT to seek NYSE listing for Concert shares.</title>
<headline>BT to seek NYSE listing for Concert shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Monday it would seek a listing on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) for the new shares in Concert Plc which will be issued to MCI Communications Corp shareholders.</p>
<p>BT said the new shares would be traded as Concert American Depositary Receipts. BT said it expected the merger with MCI into Concert to be completed later this year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
